# CI Stabilization: Enforcing Sovereign Autonomy

The current GitHub Action workflows are failing due to a fatal `OPENAI_API_KEY` check in the core swarm loop. This plan enforces "True Independence" by ensuring the system defaults to local and Antigravity-based inference in CI environments without external API keys.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change will strictly default the CI environment to `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE=true`. This means GitHub Actions will rely on local simulation or Antigravity-routed inference, ensuring 0% failure from missing secrets.

## Proposed Changes

### [GitHub Workflows]

#### [MODIFY] [autonomous_swarm.yml](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.github/workflows/autonomous_swarm.yml)
- Inject `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE: "true"` into the environment for all steps.

#### [MODIFY] [quantum_evolution.yml](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.github/workflows/quantum_evolution.yml)
- Inject `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE: "true"` into the environment.

---

### [Swarm Core]

#### [MODIFY] [loop.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/loop.ts)
- Relax the `OPENAI_API_KEY` check.
- If `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE` is set or if we are in a `CI` environment, do not exit.

#### [MODIFY] [llm_client.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/llm_client.ts)
- Lazy-load the `OpenAI` and `Anthropic` SDKs.
- This prevents top-level errors if the environment isn't perfectly configured for cloud SDKs that aren't even being used in sovereign mode.

#### [MODIFY] [hyper_model_router.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/hyper/hyper_model_router.ts)
- Adjust complexity weights to favor `willow` and `consensus` (local) over `gpt4` when `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE` is active.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run test` (if applicable) and manually trigger a local swarm cycle with `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE=true` to verify it skips the OpenAI key check.

### Manual Verification
- Commit the changes and monitor the GitHub Actions tab to ensure the "Autonomous Swarm Cycle" and "Quantum Self-Evolution" workflows finish with 🟢 SUCCESS.
